 permanently removed from all IWVPL competitions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All logos, graphics, league branding, website content, videos, fixtures, and promotional materials are the intellectual property of IWVPL unless otherwise stated and may not be reproduced without written permission.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">IWVPL operates independently and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Electronic Arts Inc., EA SPORTS, UEFA, the Premier League, or any other football governing body unless expressly stated.<br>IWVPL Policies<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">IWVPL is committed to maintaining a professional, transparent, and competitive esports environment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All players, team owners, captains, managers, and community members are expected to comply with our official policies throughout every season.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" \/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our policies include:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Fair Play and Competitive Integrity<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Player Eligibility and Registration<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Team Management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Match Scheduling<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Prize Distribution<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Code of Conduct<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Anti-Cheat Policy<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Privacy and Data Protection<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Appeals and Disciplinary Procedures<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Participants are responsible for staying informed of the latest policy updates published on the official IWVPL website and communication channels.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Failure to comply with IWVPL policies may result in warnings, point deductions, match forfeits, suspension, or permanent removal from competitions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">IWVPL reserves the right to investigate any suspected rule violations and make final decisions in the best interest of competitive integrity.<br>Contact Us<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Thank you for your interest in the Island-Wide Virtual Premier League.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether you are a player, team owner, sponsor, content creator, or community member, our team is here to assist you.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Please contact us for enquiries relating to:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>League Registration<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tournament Information<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sponsorship Opportunities<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Partnership Enquiries<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Media Requests<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Technical Support<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Rule Clarifications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>General Feedback<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Official Website<br><a href=\"https:\/\/iwvpl.asia\/\">https:\/\/iwvpl.asia\/<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Email<br><a href=\"mailto:iwvplofficial@gmail.com\">iwvplofficial@gmail.com<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Discord<br><a href=\"https:\/\/discord.gg\/3fHDGz8SFZ\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/discord.gg\/3fHDGz8SFZ\">ISLAND-WIDE VIRTUAL PREMIER LEAGUE<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our administration team aims to respond to all enquiries as quickly as possible during business hours.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" class=\"um-toggle-gdpr\" data-toggle-state=\"hidden\"\n\t\t\tdata-toggle-show=\"Show privacy policy\"\n\t\t\tdata-toggle-hide=\"Hide privacy policy\">\n\t\t\tShow privacy policy\t\t<\/a>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"um-field-area\">\n\t\t<label class=\"um-field-checkbox\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"use_gdpr_agreement\" value=\"1\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"um-field-checkbox-state\"><i class=\"um-icon-android-checkbox-outline-blank\"><\/i><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"um-field-checkbox-option\">Please confirm that you agree to our privacy poli